An Elman RNN cell with tanh or ReLU non-linearity.

    .. math::

        h' = \tanh(W_{ih} x + b_{ih}  +  W_{hh} h + b_{hh})

    If :attr:`nonlinearity` is `'relu'`, then ReLU is used in place of tanh.

    Args:
